OL,3,AWater firm pleads guilty after four
OL,4,Akilled in blast
OL,5,
OL,6,FAn Avon and Somerset Police
OL,7,Finvestigation into manslaughter was
OL,8,Fdropped in 2024 but the Health and
OL,9,FSafety Executive (HSE) undertook its
OL,10,Fown investigation to determine if
OL,11,Fcriminal offences had been committed
OL,12,Funder health and safety laws.
OL,14,FAt a hearing at Bristol Magistrates'
OL,15,FCourt earlier, Wessex Water pleaded
OL,16,Fguilty to three charges under the
OL,17,FHealth and Safety at Work Act.
OL,23,APub: 13-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG8/39
