OL,3,AWhat we know about the global Microsoft
OL,4,Aoutage
OL,5,
OL,6,FMicrosoft 365 Services, including
OL,7,FTeams, Outlook and Microsoft's
OL,8,Fartificial intelligence software
OL,9,FCopilot, have been affected by
OL,10,F"connectivity problems".
OL,23,APub: 13-NovQpppppppppppppppppppppG10/39
